sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Citizen
    participant Client as Browser / Client (GrievancePage)
    participant GrvAPI as Next.js API (/api/grievance)
    participant OfficerUI as Officer Desk UI
    actor Officer as Grievance Officer
    participant Prisma as Prisma Client (lib/prisma.ts)
    participant DB as Database
    participant Notify as Notification Service

    Citizen->>Client: Submit Grievance Ticket (Subject, ARN, Details)
    Client->>GrvAPI: POST /api/grievance
    activate GrvAPI

    GrvAPI->>GrvAPI: generateTicketNumber() -> GRV-2026-00319
    GrvAPI->>Prisma: Create Grievance (status: OPEN)
    Prisma->>DB: INSERT Grievance
    DB-->>Prisma: Inserted
    Prisma-->>GrvAPI: Record

    GrvAPI->>Notify: Send acknowledgment email
    GrvAPI-->>Client: 201 Created { ticketNumber }
    deactivate GrvAPI

    Client-->>Citizen: Display Confirmation with Ticket ID

    Officer->>OfficerUI: View open complaints
    OfficerUI->>GrvAPI: GET /api/grievance?status=OPEN
    GrvAPI->>Prisma: Fetch open grievances
    Prisma-->>GrvAPI: Open tickets
    GrvAPI-->>OfficerUI: Return ticket list

    Officer->>OfficerUI: Assign to self (IN_REVIEW)
    OfficerUI->>GrvAPI: PATCH status -> IN_REVIEW
    GrvAPI->>Prisma: Update status

    Officer->>OfficerUI: Enter resolution remarks & Submit
    OfficerUI->>GrvAPI: POST /api/grievance/{id}/resolve
    activate GrvAPI
    GrvAPI->>Prisma: UPDATE Grievance (status: RESOLVED, notes, timestamp)
    Prisma->>DB: Persist resolution
    GrvAPI->>Notify: Email resolution details to citizen
    GrvAPI-->>OfficerUI: 200 OK (Resolved)
    deactivate GrvAPI

    Citizen->>Client: Acknowledge resolution & Close ticket
    Client->>GrvAPI: POST /api/grievance/{id}/close
    GrvAPI->>Prisma: UPDATE Grievance (status: CLOSED)
    GrvAPI-->>Client: 200 OK (Closed)
    Client-->>Citizen: Ticket closed with satisfaction feedback
